    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Tanzania's Minister of Education Hon. Joyce Ndalichako will be the chief guest at the forthcoming Fifth Africa Regional Congress of the  International Commission on Mathematical Instruction (ICMI)  on Mathematical Education ( AFRICME ), which will be held between August 29and 31 at the Institute for Educational Development East Africa in Dar es Salaam.",
